      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:031a94b308b1e8916aa15245",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们一起来回顾一下历史吧～\n说不定能想到新的格言哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "045bd184918e0ee8dca9ae29e189973fb3ea63e09ad6e82376678180a2b62e0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f66d64c78b0febc84b9bf0fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要参加比赛吗？\n那我现在就去做准备！",
